---
title: Incident response loop
---
flowchart LR
  A[Alert or trigger] --> B[Gather logs, metrics, topology, code]
  B --> C[Search memory and knowledge]
  C --> D{Classify symptom}
  D -->|Code defect| E[File GitHub issue
with impact + file:line]
  D -->|Config fault| F{Run mode}
  F -->|Review| G[Human approve / deny]
  F -->|Autonomous| H[Execute scoped Azure CLI / ARM action]
  G --> H
  H --> I[Verify recovery]
  E --> J[Learn for next incident]
  I --> J
